    <Shape Type="Text" CutIndex="0" Font="Sans Serif,-1,100,5,50,0,0,0,0,0" Str="A hush of electrons hums beneath the city, and perception slips &#10;between the cracks like a thought you almost remember.&#10;A dark rose blooms in the code’s shadow, beautiful and thorned, &#10;leaving stains of midnight on the packet streams.&#10;Ghosts move in the backchannels — &#10;quiet, patient, folding through firewalls like wind through paper.&#10;We trade curiosities and contraband ideas, little parcels of forbidden &#10;knowledge and polished warez that glint like contraband moonlight.&#10;There is a sweetness to the deliberate mischief, &#10;a careful art to making the invisible sing.&#10;When the screen goes quiet you can still feel the echo of &#10;fingertips that once danced there, leaving traces like constellations.&#10;We are cartographers of the unseen — mapping rumor &#10;into truth, and always, always laughing at the system’s proud certainty." H="12.366078" LS="0" LnS="0" Ah="1" Av="1" Weld="1" HasBackupPath="1">
